swer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-43291" :question/id #uuid "a7dc2170-1f88-5ea2-a622-698bc8f5a8c8" :question/math-academy-id "q-43291" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }.$" :question/worked-solution "We put both terms over a common denominator, and combine the two fractions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )} \\\\  & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )}^{2}}{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )}^{2}}{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +1-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{({sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta )+1-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1+1-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )}{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }=2\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta .\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-43291/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1bc8c875-3393-5fd6-90cf-87737e16f2f2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-43291"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65242/selection/7d920e389672c4d472f44fae89e979f42917a5f0bacea2b8b1eb07f23089e5e4" :answer/id #uuid "8703a7bb-64a8-53d2-baa1-cb8bec8da121" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65242/selection/d0af8fbcb82254b4c49edcaaa24c812efe48bbb53d20e784732c925651c699bd" :answer/id #uuid "62df7017-dd05-5781-823b-58ceae6caabd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sin}^{3}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65242/selection/02c776c73871b4dccfdfdf9f1de0c6e6681856b390530f9f76069de4c7ff177b" :answer/id #uuid "99b3a21f-f804-5079-9237-c7ba45995e62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{sin}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65242/selection/0a3c6954e929381606f30cbb5c99fcaf4d1e515c5ab37cbf2596b1f5b25c0c85" :answer/id #uuid "67629e5c-0bcd-5caf-991f-2eb02622bf56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{sin}^{3}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65242/selection/19370c9253530adcb101aa7c26707d5ff9a04952be68f2880b0cc7cfca4a41a0" :answer/id #uuid "1eea05d5-6ede-58a0-b4b7-12e908839696" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65242/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "28dfb25a-d3d8-5c90-93db-d5681f0340d4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65242/selection/d0af8fbcb82254b4c49edcaaa24c812efe48bbb53d20e784732c925651c699bd" :answer-field/choices ["q-65242/selection/7d920e389672c4d472f44fae89e979f42917a5f0bacea2b8b1eb07f23089e5e4" "q-65242/selection/d0af8fbcb82254b4c49edcaaa24c812efe48bbb53d20e784732c925651c699bd" "q-65242/selection/02c776c73871b4dccfdfdf9f1de0c6e6681856b390530f9f76069de4c7ff177b" "q-65242/selection/0a3c6954e929381606f30cbb5c99fcaf4d1e515c5ab37cbf2596b1f5b25c0c85" "q-65242/selection/19370c9253530adcb101aa7c26707d5ff9a04952be68f2880b0cc7cfca4a41a0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65242" :question/id #uuid "8e963a6f-8389-5581-b393-ae7fbf5d7d1f" :question/math-academy-id "q-65242" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression ${sin}^{5}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x{sin}^{3}⁡x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor ${sin}^{3}⁡x$ from the expression:\n\n$$\n{sin}^{5}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x{sin}^{3}⁡x={sin}^{3}⁡x\\cdot ({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)\n$$\n\nThen, we use ${sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x=1$ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{3}⁡x\\cdot ({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x) & ={sin}^{3}⁡x\\cdot 1 \\\\  & ={sin}^{3}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that\n\n$$\n{sin}^{5}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x{sin}^{3}⁡x={sin}^{3}⁡x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65242/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3332b534-bd04-5e86-995e-1e6d691d8e1b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65242"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-119381/selection/ee20546a7cbdf0d50bfb134843c961a270619ebd3c9fe16bf84a25a5e54aed08" :answer/id #uuid "16e20f5a-308b-5ed2-9c26-f51ecdda727b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119381/selection/0631f9aa352e13d0063085866162713fba93fae3dc26a62dfbb3b17317d17fc2" :answer/id #uuid "5b79bfc8-676e-503e-946d-79385b847734" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119381/selection/b6bc771c6c4d6ecffad24c62f236d0776a81ff92915b732d59464430311f44b9" :answer/id #uuid "fd8433ab-0870-5ee6-b35b-d356bfb83b83" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119381/selection/184dec7ce2328a725848a5f84f70794248875e3bb8c892e88c59a57832a11672" :answer/id #uuid "4073f40b-f338-5512-8805-07da0b91533e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119381/selection/e3269797825f45b365a0428c9612149797fe456b192c1b6a489985ced8bd257f" :answer/id #uuid "149d5725-1e14-5155-9da6-56ce57bba912" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119381/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ffb74cdf-9966-5f6e-ae4d-1ade8b619ef8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-119381/selection/e3269797825f45b365a0428c9612149797fe456b192c1b6a489985ced8bd257f" :answer-field/choices ["q-119381/selection/ee20546a7cbdf0d50bfb134843c961a270619ebd3c9fe16bf84a25a5e54aed08" "q-119381/selection/0631f9aa352e13d0063085866162713fba93fae3dc26a62dfbb3b17317d17fc2" "q-119381/selection/b6bc771c6c4d6ecffad24c62f236d0776a81ff92915b732d59464430311f44b9" "q-119381/selection/184dec7ce2328a725848a5f84f70794248875e3bb8c892e88c59a57832a11672" "q-119381/selection/e3269797825f45b365a0428c9612149797fe456b192c1b6a489985ced8bd257f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-119381" :question/id #uuid "07c79843-d608-549b-bcdf-0073c53dea96" :question/math-academy-id "q-119381" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $\\frac{{cos}^{4}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the numerator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{cos}^{4}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }=\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta ({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )+{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }\n$$\n\nNext, we use the Pythagorean identity to rewrite the expression in the parentheses, and then we simplify the resulting expression as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta ({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )+{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1+{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot \\cancel{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }}{\\cancel{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{cos}^{4}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }=2\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta .\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-119381/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "868125f0-22e0-57fc-9620-f3242419a689"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-119381"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-119387/selection/31d758922ed389cfa4f467b10965b3bb75c0c5fc00f4ca1227fb0dc7c99d2555" :answer/id #uuid "710f6324-c1c6-5b06-b752-9ef49eb8b494" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta -1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119387/selection/82c45f4df2439620e53b221a8cd624df48d9a9a6f528bc089ec82dd3f3a9dba5" :answer/id #uuid "66902a3d-f8a3-50d0-871e-a4e0c1ec6e97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta +1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119387/selection/a24f96f0ea2f9896e68b078d7205cc9f34ac80b4ed9c403eaa0714db3d124d8c" :answer/id #uuid "b1f311e6-2637-54c1-a3eb-72d0fcc85b10"