expression in the parentheses, and then we simplify the resulting expression as much as possible.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{{sin}^{3}⁡\\theta \\cdot ({sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta )} & =\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{{sin}^{3}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{{sin}^{3}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{{sin}^{5}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{3}⁡\\theta {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }=\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-119387/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "868125f0-22e0-57fc-9620-f3242419a689"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-119387"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-119773/selection/d23a8bbdf51f8ee995cf6a2f881e25fa30ae740c8345a13abcd18eec97a230f5" :answer/id #uuid "133ec3b4-7b40-5f64-9241-f13009d8da51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119773/selection/f91178442a2ed392022f389940d897402f1620ec96f73c2a815fc74dda739ddc" :answer/id #uuid "1161400f-fac5-54cb-b47d-c897b6913ac1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119773/selection/c61a8bb2ee6ad6909372c3e2ab2751901cc0927e14ddd97b6013a80888e363fb" :answer/id #uuid "13daada9-5931-591e-9f2b-25654b755037" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119773/selection/be806f452e4646a6154f8086eed1e6b6dff7c24fbc55dfaa11f96b039579f164" :answer/id #uuid "6623c070-2c4d-53f8-a668-02bab38fc350" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119773/selection/f84d9a468e2e93ab3360d6a071bddee79cf9443cbe04a3dee5a244201e3334f2" :answer/id #uuid "ff4117ea-6eca-5a30-b380-bf0871a75acf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119773/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4238ba6b-2e70-5283-b7ea-82c97366ed76" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-119773/selection/c61a8bb2ee6ad6909372c3e2ab2751901cc0927e14ddd97b6013a80888e363fb" :answer-field/choices ["q-119773/selection/d23a8bbdf51f8ee995cf6a2f881e25fa30ae740c8345a13abcd18eec97a230f5" "q-119773/selection/f91178442a2ed392022f389940d897402f1620ec96f73c2a815fc74dda739ddc" "q-119773/selection/c61a8bb2ee6ad6909372c3e2ab2751901cc0927e14ddd97b6013a80888e363fb" "q-119773/selection/be806f452e4646a6154f8086eed1e6b6dff7c24fbc55dfaa11f96b039579f164" "q-119773/selection/f84d9a468e2e93ab3360d6a071bddee79cf9443cbe04a3dee5a244201e3334f2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-119773" :question/id #uuid "a50909c4-a6a9-5b36-a619-4604d6f9a9f9" :question/math-academy-id "q-119773" :question/problem "$1+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }=$" :question/worked-solution "We put both terms over a common denominator, and combine the two fractions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{1}{1}+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot (1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )}{1\\cdot (1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )}+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify using the Pythagorean identity, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{1+1}{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n1+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }=\\frac{2}{1+{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-119773/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1bc8c875-3393-5fd6-90cf-87737e16f2f2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-119773"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
